## Load the Titanic Dataset

The Titanic dataset was converted from Excel to CSV before starting
the lab.

We will load the CSV file using Pandas `read_csv()`.

Code Cell 2

titanic = pd.read_csv("titanic.csv")

print(titanic.head())

